  "questions": [
    "The eight proposed categories (carver to runner) and their words wait on Astra's OK.",
    "marble-carver is listed as a carver (it reshapes a scan); it also paints the weathering, so it could be a painter.",
    "world-spawn-tool makes a new world project, not 3D objects, so it is listed as a builder although its name says spawn.",
    "Astra, 2026-10-24: \"I want to rename the tools.\" The old-to-new table is in the README and under renames here; the files, Unity menus and world repos are not renamed yet."
